CodeBlock  props: { code, language='bash', title, showLineNumbers=false }
  - Title bar: shows language/title label on left, Copy button on right
  - Copy button toggles to a green checkmark for 2 seconds after click
  - Uses a hand-crafted Prism theme matching the token.* colors above
  - *** CRITICAL BUG TO AVOID ***
    All code content is passed as JS template literals. Any shell variable
    like ${varname} WILL be evaluated as JavaScript and throw ReferenceError
    if the variable is undeclared, blanking the entire page.
    ALWAYS escape shell variables: write \${varname} not ${varname}.
    Shell command substitution $() is safe — only ${} needs escaping.

InfoBox  props: { type, title, children }
  types: info(blue) | tip(green) | warning(yellow) | danger(red) | exam(rh-red)
  Each type has a matching lucide icon and border/background tint.

FlowDiagram  props: { title, steps: [{label, sub, color, icon}] }
  - Renders a vertical timeline with a gradient red→gray line on the left
  - Each step is a colored card (colors: default/red/blue/green/yellow/purple)

HorizontalFlow  props: { steps: [{label, sub, color}] }
  - Renders left-to-right boxes connected by arrow dividers
  - Overflow-x scrollable for small screens

CommandTable  props: { title, rows: [{cmd, desc, note}] }
  - Striped rows, monospace red text for the cmd column
  - Horizontally scrollable

PageHeader  props: { icon, title, subtitle, tags[] }
  - Large H1, subtitle paragraph, colored pill tags
  - Icon displayed in a rh-red tinted box on the left

